PLACEHOLDER: Inspector UI — Memory Graph screenshot

This is a placeholder file. In a real deployment, this would be a PNG screenshot captured from a local browser run.

To capture:
1. Start the MemKeys server: `cargo run -p memkeys-server`
2. Start the Inspector: `cd frontend && npm run dev`
3. Navigate to http://localhost:3001
4. Configure tenant and API connection
5. Open the Memory Graph panel
6. Select a start node and configure traversal
7. Take a screenshot and save as `inspector-memory-graph.png`

The screenshot should show:
- Graph visualization with nodes and edges
- Start node selector (kind + id)
- Direction/depth/edge-type controls
- Truncation or dangling-edge warnings (if applicable)
- Legend (if shown)